Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 687 "Preparing for Research"
    Journal for karus "You must help research preparation of [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must help research preparation of [Senior Researcher] Aldos."
    Collect 50 of 379061000
    Collect 20 of 389020000

Requires player level >= 65 and quest 686 is completed

Rewards
    Give 5000000 experience
    Give 100000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Chief Researcher] Gaz needs materials for his experiment."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Chief Researcher] Aldos needs materials for his experiment."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "So did you decide to help me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "If you have decided to help me, please first bring me the apparatus. I need a catalyst called [Potion of Soul] and [Magician's Stone] to test its reaction to pure magic. You can get them from [Potion Merchant] and [Store] respectively. Please hurry.\n\nWe need to get the [Sorcerer's Stone]and the [Potion of soul] from the [Sundries] to [Senior Researcher]Gaz in Eslant."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "So did you decide to help me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "If you have decided to help me, please first bring me the apparatus. I need a catalyst called [Potion of Soul] and [Magician's Stone] to test its reaction to pure magic. You can get them from [Potion Merchant] and [Store] respectively. Please hurry.\n\nWe need to get the [Sorcerer's Stone]and the [Potion of soul] from the [Sundries] to [Senior Researcher]Aldos in Eslant."

On in_progress
    Say "You don't have enough money? You lack a lot of stuff."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Good, you have collect them well.\n\nThen, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature.\nFirst collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Shaman]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Good, you have collect them well.\n\nThen, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature. \nFirst collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Shaman]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause."

On completed
    Say "Please come back to me when you reach Lv66. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
